<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在线社区很少关注政治，许多人表示应该保持这种状态</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/20/online-communities-rarely-focus-on-politics-and-many-say-it-should-stay-that-way/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PI_26.1-.20_Politics-cmnty_Featured-image.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在线社区中的大多数人在他们的首选空间中几乎看不到政治，54% 的人表示政治不属于那里。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/20/online-communities-rarely-focus-on-politics-and-many-say-it-should-stay-that-way/</guid></item><item><title>公众对美国选举抱有广泛信心——但党派人士对选举准入和安全的担忧存在分歧</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/20/broad-public-confidence-in-elections-in-the-u-s-but-partisans-differ-over-concerns-about-access-security/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PP_2026.10.20_election-confidence_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;大多数选民预计 2026 年中期选举会顺利进行，但共和党和民主党在非公民投票保障措施以及符合条件的公民选择投票是否可以投票方面存在分歧。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/politics/2026/10/20/broad-public-confidence-in-elections-in-the-u-s-but-partisans-differ-over-concerns-about-access-security/</guid></item><item><title>测验：您的公民性格是什么？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/quiz/what-is-your-civic-personality/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PJ_26.10.20_CivicQuiz_topic.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;参加我们的公民性格测验，了解您与其他美国成年人相比，对新闻、政治、宗教和公民活动的参与程度如何。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/quiz/what-is-your-civic-personality/</guid></item><item><title>2026 年美国人对互联网、宽带的使用情况</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/internet/fact-sheet/internet-broadband/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2017/01/PI_17.01.10_FactSheet_internetBroadband_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;互联网代表了美国人相互联系、收集信息和日常生活方式的根本转变。探索美国互联网和家庭宽带采用的模式、趋势和统计数据。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/internet/fact-sheet/internet-broadband/</guid></item><item><title>2026 年美国人对社交媒体的使用情况</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/internet/fact-sheet/social-media/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="